    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d614">

                <pb facs="0597" n="507" sameAs="frus:frus1918Russiav02/pg507"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 861.00/2419</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Consul at Archangel</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Cole</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Department of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Extract]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Archangel</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1918-08-04T18:00:00+04:31"><hi rendition="#italic">August 4, 1918,
                                6 p.m.</hi></date>
                        <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received August 6, 11.15
                        a.m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>83. Government of northern territory formed during night of August 1, containing
                    nine members as follows: seven members of the Constituent Assembly from
                    provinces of Archangel, Vyatka, Vologda, Novgorod, Kazan, Samara, from old
                    northern front, also assistant mayor Vologda city and [vice] president Archangel
                    city Duma, N. V. Chaikovski being president thereof.</p>
                <p>City quiet. Pierce and other Americans safe. …</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Cole</hi></signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
